-### Step 9: Point Agents At The Knowledge Store, And Offer The Standing Directives
+### 第 9 步：在知识库中指定代理，并提供常规指令
 
-Runs whenever the repository has a root agent-instructions file (`AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `GEMINI.md`, or the equivalent this project uses). When one file only `@`-includes another, the substantive file is the target. No such file: skip this step and say so in the summary; setup never creates one.
+每当存储库具有根代理指令文件（`AGENTS.md`、`CLAUDE.md`、`GEMINI.md` 或此项目使用的等效文件）时运行。当一个文件仅`@`-包含另一个文件时，实质性文件就是目标。没有这样的文件：跳过这一步并在摘要中注明；安装程序永远不会创建一个。
 
-**Outcome:** an agent that reads the file learns that the knowledge store exists at the resolved `<root>/solutions/` and when it is relevant, and the file carries a standing instruction for capturing learnings and one for the agent's own chat replies if the user wants them. Each addition is offered separately, previewed with its exact placement, and applied only on approval.
+**结果：** 读取该文件的代理了解到知识存储存在于已解析的`<root>/solutions/`以及相关的时间，并且该文件包含用于捕获学习内容的常规指令以及用于代理自己的聊天回复（如果用户需要）的指令。每个添加项均单独提供，并以其确切位置进行预览，并且仅在批准后应用。
 
-**Store mention.** Read the file and judge semantically, not by string match, whether a reader would learn three things: a store of documented solutions exists at the concrete path, enough of its shape to search it (categories, YAML frontmatter fields such as `module`, `tags`, `problem_type`), and that it is relevant when implementing or debugging in a documented area. When the spirit is met, offer nothing. Otherwise draft the smallest addition in the file's own style: one line in the closest existing section (a directory listing, architecture tree, conventions block) beats a new heading, and a new heading is the last resort. Keep the tone informational, not imperative, because an imperative causes redundant reads when a workflow already searches. Write the concrete resolved path, never the `<root>` placeholder, since people and plugin-less agents read this file. Calibration for a directory listing:
+**存储提及。** 读取文件并从语义上判断，而不是通过字符串匹配，读者是否会学到三件事：在具体路径中存在文档化解决方案的存储，其形状足以搜索它（类别，YAMLfrontmatter字段，例如`module`，`tags`，`problem_type`），以及在文档区域中实现或调试时相关。当精神满足时，什么也不提供。否则，以文件自己的风格起草最小的添加内容：最接近的现有部分（目录列表、体系结构树、约定块）中的一行击败新标题，而新标题是最后的手段。保持语气是信息性的，而不是命令式的，因为当工作流已经搜索时，命令式会导致冗余读取。写入具体的解析路径，切勿使用 `<root>` 占位符，因为人们和无插件代理会读取此文件。目录列表的校准：
 
 ```text
-<root>/solutions/  # documented solutions to past problems (bugs, best practices, workflow patterns), organized by category with YAML frontmatter (module, tags, problem_type)
+<root>/solutions/ # 针对过去问题（错误、最佳实践、工作流程模式）的记录解决方案，按类别通过YAML frontmatter（模块、标签、problem_type）进行组织
 ```
 
-**Compounding directive.** Offer it only when the repository treats the store as tracked, committed knowledge: git tracks at least one file under the resolved `<root>/solutions/` (`git ls-files` there is non-empty; an untracked or gitignored directory is not evidence), or the user just accepted the store mention. Skip the offer when the file already carries a standing instruction to invoke `ce-compound`, in any wording, that runs at a completion checkpoint and lets the skill decide whether a lesson qualifies. When the existing instruction has the agent first decide whether the lesson deserves a document, offer to replace it with the bundled variant of the same kind (ask first or automatic). That pre-judgment skips lessons the skill would hold in a test or a coding standard. Otherwise offer it. The user should learn that agents would then record a lesson as a test, a coding standard, or a learning after work that corrected a wrong belief about how something behaves, so the next agent does not repeat the mistake. The choices are that agents ask first, that they do it without asking, or no instruction.
+**知识沉淀指令。** 仅当存储库将存储视为可跟踪的、已提交的数据时才提供它：git 跟踪已解析的 `<root>/solutions/` 下的至少一个文件（`git ls-files` 非空；未跟踪或 gitignored 目录不是证据），或者用户刚刚接受了存储提及。当文件已经包含调用 `ce-compound` 的常设指令（以任何措辞）时，请跳过该提议，该指令在完成检查点运行并让技能决定课程是否合格。当现有指令让代理首先决定课程是否值得文档时，建议将其替换为同类的捆绑变体（首先询问或自动）。这种预先判断会跳过该技能在测试或编码标准中所包含的课程。否则提供。用户应该了解到，代理会记录课程作为测试、编码标准或下班后的学习，纠正对某些行为的错误信念，这样下一个代理就不会重复错误。选择是代理人首先询问，他们在没有询问或没有指示的情况下进行操作。
 
-Insert the chosen variant verbatim from `assets/compounding-directive.md` in this skill's directory; the wording is pinned by a test, so do not paraphrase it. Place it beside the store mention when that landed in a conventions or working-agreement block, otherwise in the block where the file states how agents should work. Match the surrounding form (a bullet in a bullet list, a paragraph in prose). Say where the text would go and what it asks agents to do, and show the exact text if the user asks. Append only on approval and leave the rest of the file untouched.
+从 Skill 目录读取 `assets/compounding-directive.md`，将选中的正文原样插入项目指令文件；该措辞是通过测试确定的，因此请勿对其进行解释。当它落在约定或工作协议块中时，将其放置在知识库入口旁边，否则放置在文件说明代理应如何工作的块中。匹配周围的形式（项目符号列表中的项目符号、散文中的段落）。说明文本的去向以及要求代理执行的操作，并在用户询问时显示确切的文本。仅在批准后追加，文件的其余部分保持不变。
 
